WEBVTT

00:00:08.811 --> 00:00:11.988
I'VE ALWAYS LIKED
THESE FLAMES HERMIONE MAKES.

00:00:15.166 --> 00:00:18.560
HOW LONG DO YOU RECKON
SHE'LL STAY MAD AT ME?

00:00:18.604 --> 00:00:20.867
WELL, JUST KEEP TALKING

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.565
ABOUT THAT LITTLE BALL OF LIGHT
TOUCHING YOUR HEART,

00:00:23.609 --> 00:00:25.132
AND SHE'LL COME 'ROUND.

00:00:25.176 --> 00:00:27.961
[ CHUCKLES ]
IT WAS TRUE. EVERY WORD.

00:00:29.484 --> 00:00:32.748
THIS IS GONNA SOUND CRAZY,

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:34.707
BUT I THINK THAT'S WHY
DUMBLEDORE LEFT IT TO ME --

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.362
THE DELUMINATOR.

00:00:37.405 --> 00:00:40.147
I THINK HE KNEW THAT, SOMEHOW,
I'D NEED IT TO FIND MY WAY BACK,

00:00:40.191 --> 00:00:42.628
AND SHE'D LEAD ME.

00:00:44.891 --> 00:00:48.155
BLOODY HELL, I JUST REALIZED.
YOU NEED A WAND, DON'T YOU?

00:00:48.199 --> 00:00:49.461
YEAH.

00:00:49.504 --> 00:00:50.723
I'VE GOT ONE HERE.

00:00:50.766 --> 00:00:52.725
IT'S A BLACKTHORN.

00:00:52.768 --> 00:00:54.030
TEN INCHES.

00:00:54.074 --> 00:00:57.208
NOTHING SPECIAL,
BUT I RECKON IT'LL DO.

00:00:57.251 --> 00:01:00.950
TOOK IT OFF A SNATCHER
A COUPLE OF WEEKS AGO.

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.648
DON'T TELL HERMIONE THIS,

00:01:02.691 --> 00:01:05.085
BUT THEY'RE A BIT DIM,
SNATCHERS.

00:01:05.129 --> 00:01:07.740
THIS ONE WAS DEFINITELY
PART TROLL, THE SMELL OF HIM.

00:01:07.783 --> 00:01:09.176
ENGORGIO.

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:11.657
REDUCIO!Hermione:
WHAT'S GOING ON IN THERE?

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.093
NOTHING.NOTHING.

00:01:15.356 --> 00:01:17.141
WE NEED TO TALK.

00:01:17.184 --> 00:01:19.099
Y-YEAH, ALL RIGHT.

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:28.152
I WANT TO GO SEE
XENOPHILIUS LOVEGOOD.

00:01:28.195 --> 00:01:29.588
SORRY?

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:33.200
SEE THIS?

00:01:33.244 --> 00:01:35.333
IT'S A LETTER DUMBLEDORE WROTE
TO GRINDELWALD.

00:01:35.376 --> 00:01:37.073
LOOK AT THE SIGNATURE.

00:01:37.117 --> 00:01:40.555
IT'S THE MARK AGAIN.

00:01:40.599 --> 00:01:43.341
IT KEEPS CROPPING UP.

00:01:43.384 --> 00:01:45.212
IN "BEEDLE THE BARD."

00:01:45.256 --> 00:01:48.781
IN THE GRAVEYARD
IN GODRIC'S HOLLOW.

00:01:48.824 --> 00:01:51.000
Harry:
IT WAS THERE, TOO.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:52.219
WHERE?

00:01:52.263 --> 00:01:54.874
OUT-- OUTSIDE
GREGOROVITCH'S WAND SHOP.

00:01:54.917 --> 00:01:56.397
BUT WHAT DOES IT MEAN?

00:01:56.441 --> 00:01:59.226
LOOK, YOU'VE GOT NO IDEA
WHERE THE NEXT HORCRUX IS,

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:01.010
AND NEITHER DO I.

00:02:02.621 --> 00:02:05.624
BUT THIS --
THIS MEANS SOMETHING.

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.539
I'M SURE OF IT.YEAH.

00:02:07.582 --> 00:02:09.584
HERMIONE'S RIGHT.

00:02:09.628 --> 00:02:12.631
WE OUGHT TO SEE LOVEGOOD.

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:14.894
UH, LET'S VOTE ON IT.

00:02:14.937 --> 00:02:17.244
THOSE IN FAVOR?

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:33.782
[ BIRDS CHIRPING ]

00:02:40.398 --> 00:02:43.401
YOU'RE NOT STILL MAD AT HIM,
ARE YOU?

00:02:43.444 --> 00:02:45.968
I'M ALWAYS
MAD AT HIM.

00:02:48.362 --> 00:02:50.234
Ron: LUNA.

00:02:50.277 --> 00:02:52.148
Hermione and Harry:
LUNA.

00:02:52.192 --> 00:02:54.760
[ CLANKING ]

00:02:58.546 --> 00:02:59.808
[ KNOCK ON DOOR ]

00:02:59.852 --> 00:03:02.594
"KEEP OFF
THE DIRIGIBLE PLUMS."

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.647
WHAT IS IT?

00:03:12.691 --> 00:03:14.388
WHO ARE YOU?

00:03:14.432 --> 00:03:15.650
WHAT DO YOU WANT?

00:03:15.694 --> 00:03:17.913
HELLO.
MR. LOVEGOOD.

00:03:17.957 --> 00:03:20.481
I'M HARRY POTTER.
WE -- WE MET A FEW MONTHS AGO.

00:03:20.525 --> 00:03:22.657
[ FOOTSTEPS ]

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.357
COULD WE COME IN?

00:03:29.577 --> 00:03:31.057
WHERE IS LUNA?

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.407
LUNA?

00:03:33.451 --> 00:03:36.323
SHE'LL BE ALONG.

00:03:42.286 --> 00:03:44.418
[ SLURPING ]

00:03:46.115 --> 00:03:48.335
SO...

00:03:48.379 --> 00:03:51.599
HOW CAN I HELP YOU,
MR. POTTER?

00:03:51.643 --> 00:03:55.647
WELL, ACTUALLY...

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:59.085
IT WAS ABOUT SOMETHING
YOU WERE WEARING 'ROUND
YOUR NECK AT THE WEDDING.

00:03:59.128 --> 00:04:01.261
IT WAS A SYMBOL.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.351
YOU MEAN THIS?

00:04:04.395 --> 00:04:06.745
YES.

00:04:06.788 --> 00:04:08.616
THAT EXACTLY.

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:11.619
WHAT WE'VE WONDERED IS...

00:04:11.663 --> 00:04:13.273
WHAT IS IT?

00:04:13.317 --> 00:04:15.275
WHAT IS IT?

00:04:15.319 --> 00:04:18.365
W-WELL, IT'S THE SIGN OF
THE DEATHLY HALLOWS, OF COURSE.

00:04:18.409 --> 00:04:19.845
WHAT?THE WHAT?THE WHAT?

00:04:19.888 --> 00:04:22.021
THE DEATHLY HALLOWS.

00:04:22.064 --> 00:04:24.937
I ASSUME YOU'RE ALL
FAMILIAR WITH "THE TALE
OF THE THREE BROTHERS."

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.808
YEAH.YES.NO.

00:04:31.857 --> 00:04:33.946
I HAVE IT IN HERE.

00:04:33.989 --> 00:04:36.035
[ CLATTERING ]

00:04:40.431 --> 00:04:42.824
[ PAGE TURNS ]

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:46.654
"THERE WERE ONCE THREE BROTHERS

00:04:46.698 --> 00:04:49.570
"WHO WERE TRAVELING ALONG
A LONELY, WINDING ROAD

00:04:49.614 --> 00:04:51.529
AT TWILIGHT."

00:04:51.572 --> 00:04:54.270
MIDNIGHT.
MUM ALWAYS SAID "MIDNIGHT."

00:04:59.363 --> 00:05:01.277
BUT "TWILIGHT'S" FINE.

00:05:01.321 --> 00:05:04.019
BETTER, ACTUALLY.

00:05:04.063 --> 00:05:06.979
DO YOU WANT TO READ IT?

00:05:07.022 --> 00:05:09.460
NO.
IT'S FINE.

00:05:10.939 --> 00:05:13.420
"THERE WERE ONCE THREE BROTHERS

00:05:13.464 --> 00:05:16.423
"WHO WERE TRAVELING ALONG
A LONELY, WINDING ROAD

00:05:16.467 --> 00:05:18.599
AT TWILIGHT."

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:26.259
"IN TIME, THE BROTHERS REACHED
A RIVER TOO TREACHEROUS TO PASS.

00:05:26.302 --> 00:05:28.696
"BUT, BEING LEARNED
IN THE MAGICAL ARTS,

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:31.351
"THE THREE BROTHERS
SIMPLY WAVED THEIR WANDS

00:05:31.395 --> 00:05:33.048
AND MADE A BRIDGE."

00:05:34.354 --> 00:05:36.922
"BEFORE THEY COULD CROSS,
HOWEVER,

00:05:36.965 --> 00:05:41.100
"THEY FOUND THEIR PATH
BLOCKED BY A HOODED FIGURE.

00:05:41.143 --> 00:05:42.754
"IT WAS DEATH.

00:05:42.797 --> 00:05:45.060
"AND HE FELT CHEATED --

00:05:45.104 --> 00:05:48.586
"CHEATED BECAUSE TRAVELERS WOULD
NORMALLY DROWN IN THE RIVER.

00:05:48.629 --> 00:05:51.197
"BUT DEATH WAS CUNNING.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.373
"HE PRETENDED TO CONGRATULATE
THE THREE BROTHERS

00:05:53.417 --> 00:05:54.722
"ON THEIR MAGIC

00:05:54.766 --> 00:05:57.333
"AND SAID THAT EACH
HAD EARNED A PRIZE

00:05:57.377 --> 00:06:00.249
"FOR HAVING BEEN CLEVER
ENOUGH TO EVADE HIM.

00:06:00.293 --> 00:06:02.251
"THE OLDEST ASKED FOR A WAND

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:04.993
"MORE POWERFUL
THAN ANY IN EXISTENCE.

00:06:05.037 --> 00:06:07.343
"SO, DEATH FASHIONED HIM ONE

00:06:07.387 --> 00:06:10.695
"FROM AN ELDER TREE
THAT STOOD NEARBY.

00:06:10.738 --> 00:06:12.348
"THE SECOND BROTHER

00:06:12.392 --> 00:06:15.613
"DECIDED HE WANTED TO
HUMILIATE DEATH EVEN FURTHER

00:06:15.656 --> 00:06:17.441
"AND ASKED FOR THE POWER

00:06:17.484 --> 00:06:20.269
"TO RECALL LOVED ONES
FROM THE GRAVE.

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:22.620
"SO, DEATH PLUCKED A STONE
FROM THE RIVER

00:06:22.663 --> 00:06:25.405
"AND OFFERED IT TO HIM.

00:06:25.449 --> 00:06:30.454
"FINALLY, DEATH TURNED
TO THE THIRD BROTHER.

00:06:30.497 --> 00:06:33.108
"A HUMBLE MAN,
HE ASKED FOR SOMETHING

00:06:33.152 --> 00:06:36.503
"THAT WOULD ALLOW HIM
TO GO FORTH FROM THAT PLACE

00:06:36.547 --> 00:06:40.899
"WITHOUT BEING FOLLOWED
BY DEATH.

00:06:40.942 --> 00:06:43.554
"AND SO IT WAS THAT DEATH
RELUCTANTLY HANDED OVER

00:06:43.597 --> 00:06:46.470
HIS OWN CLOAK OF INVISIBILITY."

00:06:50.169 --> 00:06:52.998
"THE FIRST BROTHER TRAVELED
TO A DISTANT VILLAGE

00:06:53.041 --> 00:06:55.522
"WHERE, WITH THE ELDER WAND
IN HAND,

00:06:55.566 --> 00:06:59.308
HE KILLED A WIZARD WITH WHOM
HE HAD ONCE QUARRELED."

00:07:01.136 --> 00:07:05.445
"DRUNK WITH THE POWER THAT
THE ELDER WAND HAD GIVEN HIM,

00:07:05.489 --> 00:07:08.579
HE BRAGGED
OF HIS INVINCIBILITY."

00:07:10.972 --> 00:07:13.061
"BUT THAT NIGHT,

00:07:13.105 --> 00:07:14.976
"ANOTHER WIZARD STOLE THE WAND

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:18.110
"AND SLIT THE BROTHER'S THROAT
FOR GOOD MEASURE.

00:07:18.153 --> 00:07:21.896
"AND SO DEATH TOOK
THE FIRST BROTHER FOR HIS OWN.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.420
"THE SECOND BROTHER
JOURNEYED TO HIS HOME

00:07:24.464 --> 00:07:27.554
"WHERE HE TOOK THE STONE
AND TURNED IT THRICE IN HAND.

00:07:27.598 --> 00:07:30.078
"TO HIS DELIGHT, THE GIRL
HE HAD ONCE HOPED TO MARRY,

00:07:30.122 --> 00:07:32.298
"BEFORE HER UNTIMELY DEATH,

00:07:32.341 --> 00:07:35.170
"APPEARED BEFORE HIM.

00:07:35.214 --> 00:07:37.521
"YET SOON SHE TURNED SAD
AND COLD,

00:07:37.564 --> 00:07:40.436
"FOR SHE DID NOT BELONG
IN THE MORTAL WORLD.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.048
"DRIVEN MAD
WITH HOPELESS LONGING,

00:07:43.091 --> 00:07:46.834
"THE SECOND BROTHER KILLED
HIMSELF SO AS TO JOIN HER.

00:07:46.878 --> 00:07:50.446
"AND SO DEATH TOOK
THE SECOND BROTHER.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.318
"AS FOR THE THIRD BROTHER,

00:07:52.361 --> 00:07:56.714
"DEATH SEARCHED FOR MANY YEARS
BUT WAS NEVER ABLE TO FIND HIM.

00:07:56.757 --> 00:07:58.672
"ONLY WHEN HE ATTAINED
A GREAT AGE

00:07:58.716 --> 00:08:01.675
"DID THE YOUNGEST BROTHER
SHED THE CLOAK OF INVISIBILITY

00:08:01.719 --> 00:08:04.765
"AND GIVE IT TO HIS SON.

00:08:04.809 --> 00:08:07.899
H"E THEN GREETED DEATH
AS AN OLD FRIEND

00:08:07.942 --> 00:08:09.770
"AND WENT WITH HIM GLADLY,

00:08:09.814 --> 00:08:12.947
DEPARTING THIS LIFE AS EQUALS."

00:08:12.991 --> 00:08:14.427
[ CROWS CAWING ]

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.211
Xenophilius:
SO, THERE YOU ARE.

00:08:16.255 --> 00:08:20.302
THOSE ARE THE DEATHLY HALLOWS.

00:08:20.346 --> 00:08:24.089
I'M SORRY, SIR.
I STILL DON'T QUITE UNDERSTAND.

00:08:24.132 --> 00:08:25.699
UH...

00:08:25.743 --> 00:08:27.614
I'LL HAVE TO GET A PROPER PEN.
I NEED TO GET A PEN.

00:08:27.658 --> 00:08:29.094
THAT'S WHAT I'LL FIND --
A LITTLE PEN.

00:08:29.137 --> 00:08:31.444
WHERE'S THAT PEN?
AH, HERE IT IS, A PEN.

